# Claude API Key for AI task breakdown
# ---
# For LOCAL development: paste your key below
# For EAS Build: set via `eas secret:create --name ANTHROPIC_API_KEY --value <key>`
#   The eas-build-pre-install.sh hook writes it into .env at build time.
# If left empty, the app uses a non-AI fallback breakdown.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here
